{"id":1150202,"chapter_id":1150202,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"消息","content":"警报，厨房发生爆炸。监控锁定嫌疑人：伊格尼。","style":11,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"地面传来微微的震动，预料之外但又在情理之中的事终究还是发生了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"等你马不停蹄赶到厨房的时候，火已经被扑灭。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"伊格尼拿着奶油盆，站在满地狼藉的厨房里不知所措。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"options":["到底怎么回事。","你这是在干嘛？"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202005,"trial_step":5,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"到底怎么回事。","goto":6},{"text":"你这是在干嘛？","goto":null}]},{"step":6,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"她又气又急，看来在MBCC接受禁闭者教育期间并没有人教会她应对这种局面的粗话。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"上次的不欢而散导致你们直到今日每每见面彼此都还有点尴尬。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"然而当下似乎正是个不错的和解机会。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"你走过去帮她收拾，伊格尼怔了怔，却并没有跑开。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"或许她也在等待这样的机会吧。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"管理局的伙食应该还不差吧？为什么还想来厨房加餐呢？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"是今天的菜不合你口味么？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"啊……也不是……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"就有点没怎么吃饱……而已。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"大概她是真的饿了。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"你突然想起，与伊格尼一同回来的同僚告诉你他们错过了午餐时间。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"options":["吃烤牛排么？","那么可以来帮我切一下牛排吗？"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202018,"trial_step":18,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"吃烤牛排么？","goto":19},{"text":"那么可以来帮我切一下牛排吗？","goto":23}]},{"step":19,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我不想吃。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"真的？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"不过假如你一定要做的话……吃……也不是不行。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"那么可以来帮我切一下牛排吗？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202022,"trial_step":22,"next":[26]},{"step":23,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"为什么我要……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"不想吃么？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你一定要做给我吃的话……帮你就帮你好了！","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202025,"trial_step":25,"next":[26]},{"step":26,"content":"伊格尼的眼神飘忽不定，似乎有些不好意思看你。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"但她接过了牛排，默默走到旁边幸存的案板上切起来。原本被冻得硬邦邦的牛排一到她的手里就变得相当顺服。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"options":["夸夸伊格尼","逗逗伊格尼"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202028,"trial_step":28,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"夸夸伊格尼","goto":29},{"text":"逗逗伊格尼","goto":31}]},{"step":29,"content":"刀工不错，还有解冻功能。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"从前餐厅的冷盘都是我负责的，所以就……还凑合。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202030,"trial_step":30,"next":[34]},{"step":31,"content":"你的手法好专业，我就切不好。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"伊格尼看了看你，手中的刀却没停下。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"当然，从前餐厅的冷盘都是我负责的。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202033,"trial_step":33,"next":[34]},{"step":34,"content":"你们有一句没一句地聊着以前的事情，伊格尼的心情似乎也变好了不少。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"那你从前除了写博客，也会为你父母的餐厅工作，对吗？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……算是吧。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"什么叫算是？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我不想说。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"伊格尼埋头自顾自地切着牛排，声音闷闷的，回绝的意味却非常明确。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"……没关系，不想说不说就是。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"啊对了，你牛排是不是快切好了？可以再帮忙炖个汤吗？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"不，我才不要。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"为什么？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"伊格尼放下了手里的刀，抬头看了你一眼又飞速移开目光，脸颊有些泛红。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我……我说了你可不准嘲笑我。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"options":["好","我不笑"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202046,"trial_step":46,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"好","goto":47},{"text":"我不笑","goto":null}]},{"step":47,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我，我一碰到火就没法控制火势，所以……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"所以大名鼎鼎的美食大师焦糖布丁，其实是不会做菜的。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"闭嘴！谁说我不会做菜了！你……你嘲笑我！","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……喂！你别笑了！洋葱都切歪了！","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"像你这样连洋葱都切不好的人有什么资格嘲笑我！","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"你清了清嗓子，急忙收敛了嘴角的笑意。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"options":["没有的事","我可没有！"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没有的事","goto":54},{"text":"我可没有！","goto":null}]},{"step":54,"content":"一定是你看错了。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我还是头一次遇到像你这样胡说八道还一点都不脸红的人呢。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"你有些尴尬地摸了摸鼻子。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"哼。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"所以……你在你父母的餐厅里只会做些冷盘，不会接近厨房。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"嗯。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"你父母最近还好吗？他们还在开餐厅吗？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"他们……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你是在套我话吗？我不想提他们。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"上次我就说了，我是我，他们是他们。我做的一切都和他们没有关系。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"options":["和伊格尼解释","向伊格尼道歉"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202064,"trial_step":64,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"和伊格尼解释","goto":65},{"text":"向伊格尼道歉","goto":null}]},{"step":65,"content":"FAC没有出卖任何人。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"我没有恶意，也不会破坏任何已经确定的事，我只是想多了解你一些。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"毕竟，我们以后会是生死与共的战友。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……好。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"她目光复杂地打量着你，像是在考量着什么，良久之后才终于下定决心般的吐出了这一个“好”字。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"她深吸了一口气。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"这是我自首时跟FAC提的条件。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我会配合他们的调查，他们让我做什么都可以，但是作为交换FAC要保护我父母，不让他们受到火灾事件的牵连。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你知道，新城对禁闭者的家庭……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"我知道。你考虑得非常周到。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"这是我为数不多还能够为他们做的事了。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"你想要牺牲自己来补偿他们？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"一直以来，都是他们在为我做出牺牲。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"在我六岁烧毁那个餐厅之前，他们本来已经有了稳定的生活，稳定的工作，稳定的收入……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"这不是你的错，伊格尼。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"是我的错，只能是我的错。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我暴露了自己的能力，而他们为了我，辞掉工作，卖掉房子来偿还餐厅老板的损失，我们只能搬到新城不知名的角落。一直都是这样，只要我不小心暴露了自己，先前好不容易积累起来的一切就会彻底清零。然后就是转学，搬家，换工作。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"伊格尼放下厨具，叹了口气。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"甚至……为了搬家方便，爸爸还把家里的小汽车换成了皮卡车，我们睡的床也一直是那种容易搬走的折叠床。门上总是装着监控，以防有人突然找上门。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"options":["你的父母很爱你。","……"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202084,"trial_step":84,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你的父母很爱你。","goto":85},{"text":"……","goto":null}]},{"step":85,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"在那以后，我们家里就堆满了灭火设备。我父母再也没有过稳定的工作，他们总在为我处理着一切。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我不敢出门跟别人玩，他们就给我买很多书。我不能做菜，妈妈就鼓励我写美食博客。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"content":"你之前还不明白，为什么伊格尼明明受到过那么多攻击和不公正的待遇，却一直能够默默忍受。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"而此时此刻你终于得到了答案——原来是她的父母一直站在她身后。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我从小就不是一个正常的孩子，在学校的时候总是没有办法跟同学好好相处。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"因为害怕暴露自己，我刻意摆出一副冷漠的姿态疏远所有人，哪怕受了欺负也只能咬着牙一声不吭。可越是这样，就会有越多的人不待见我，孤立我，欺负我……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"十四岁那年我在妈妈的建议下开始写博客，之后我的能力稳定了一段时间，我们都以为新生活就要开始了。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"只有我的父母，他们是我唯一的朋友。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"父母攒了钱把餐厅翻新，准备在美食节上正式开业。那里的每一张桌子，每一张椅子，每一块桌布，每一面装饰画都是我挑选的。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"但还是因为我，一切都没有了。什么有了起色的事业，幸福的生活，美好的未来……通通都没有了。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"我很抱歉……","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"都是因为我，我在网上太得意忘形了，我不该去追求那些我不配得到的东西，都是我的错……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"options":["不是你的错！"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202097,"trial_step":97,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不是你的错！","goto":98}]},{"step":98,"content":"你没有做错什么，那些狂热粉丝的举动不是你能预测到的。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"不，我早就该想到的。那天我认识到了一件事，只要我这颗定时炸弹还在，他们的生活就永远不可能好起来。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"这不是你的错，也不是任何人的错。不是你给他们带来了不幸，你们只是遭遇了不幸。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"你的父母也不会允许你一个人承担这痛苦。你们是家人啊，家人就是要在彼此遭遇不幸的时候相互支持，共同面对，不离不弃。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"不是的……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"如果我说，你的父母从来就没有责怪过你，相反，他们非常抗拒FAC的介入，希望能把你带回去呢？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"这是他们一年前开的新店。就算遇到挫折，你父母也没有一蹶不振，他们能凭自己手艺能重新立足。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"options":["你爱的人没那么脆弱","你不需要妄自菲薄"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202105,"trial_step":105,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你爱的人没那么脆弱","goto":106},{"text":"你不需要妄自菲薄","goto":null}]},{"step":106,"content":"你不用因为害怕伤人而强迫自己远离一切。离开只会让你和他们都感到痛苦。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"伊格尼，你想回家吗？","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"哈哈……","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"所有的挣扎最终只是变作了一声叹息，一声轻笑。她抬起头看向你的眼睛。这是你头一次看她微笑，心头却涌起了一股莫名的悲伤。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我不会回去的。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你说的这些我都知道。我想了解的，夜莺都会私下告诉我。她跟你一样爱多管闲事。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我知道他们曾经有多消沉，好几次拒绝FAC的保护计划，只因为FAC抓走了我。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我也知道他们终于慢慢振作，接受帮助，还了债，开新店，走出阴影开始新生活。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"${PlayerName}，你知道转机是什么吗？","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"你茫然地摇头，安静的空气渐渐让人不安起来。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我的爸爸妈妈有了新的女儿。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"跟我不一样，一个普通的女孩，一个真正的家人。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"报告上说，她的名字叫伊丽丝。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"content":"气氛忽然凝滞，你难以置信地看着她。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"……你干嘛这副表情呀？烦人。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"没……没事的，我还是挺高兴的。我不能永远都像一个长不大的小孩，他们做的已经足够多了。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"我一直希望他们能幸福，开始新的生活。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"伊格尼","content":"你看，只要他们能放下我，这个愿望马上就实现了。","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"她还是笑着，眼眶中的泪水始终没有落下。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":250202125,"trial_step":125}]}